A||||17||mshill||stock fuel pump, regulator, injectors in 3.4L pushrod?||||1||
Z||000000||mshill||09-25-2000||12:12 PM||||Anyone with a 3.4 pushrod using stock 2.8 fuel pump, pressure regulator and injectors?  Are you getting enough juice?  <P>I am starting a 3.4L pushrod build and want to be able to do it on a reasonable budget initially, and then add small things to the top end and exhaust later to boost performance as more $$$ become available.  If the stock 2.8 fuel system would work initially then that would be great until I get the engine breathing better (1.6:1 roller rockers, better exhaust system, etc) sometime down the road.||||reg||1
Z||000001||86SE||09-26-2000||12:09 AM||||I would like to know the same info.  As I am too starting my 3.4 project, right now!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||10
